<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL, South Africa 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal,</p>
<p>requiring 232 for victory, were 46 for three in their second</p>
<p>innings at the close on the second day of the four-day</p>
<p>Supersport Series match against Boland on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Boland 170 and 179 (K.Jackson 62, M.Davis 6-80),</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal 117 and 46-3.</p>
</text>
